2020-02-04 08:02:11',NULL,NULL),(177,228690,'Service Request','Miscellaneous: Entries Extranet',NULL,'Fulfilled','Customer got the following error message when trying to set up a new user on Extranet:\n\"Email address is an invalid format\".\n\nThe e-mail address is: exams@smsj.london','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-01-09 17:44:40',NULL,'2020-01-20 11:20:03','Entries Externate',5,'N',0,'N','N','N',NULL,NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(178,737988,'Incident','STS- Intermittent login issue ,Duplicate, Incident-737587',NULL,'Resolved','STS- Intermittent login issue ,Duplicate, Incident-737587','Alamgir Ali SK',NULL,'2020-01-17 16:50:56','2020-01-17 17:00:00','2020-01-20 11:21:39','STS',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','Duplicate, Incident-737587',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Operational','Unavoidable','Automate',NULL,'LDAP was not working , unauthenticated issue','2020-02-04 08:01:54',NULL,NULL),(179,735719,'Incident','ZD1094437 - Results Verification Service: Unable to Log in',NULL,'Resolved','\nUser Beatrice Iba reported that she is unable to log in to RVS. We have already reset her password and she was able to set up her account, however, when she tried to log back in she gets an error message. Please see below snapshots.\n\nCustomer bookmark home page which was OAuth implemented','Vivek Sen',NULL,'2020-01-09 16:36:29','2020-01-14 07:52:00','2020-01-20 11:22:50','RVS',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','Advised user to clear browser cache and access the URL directly and not from any bookmark saved since it causes an Auth0 error.\n\n',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Knowledge','Unavoidable','Industrialise',NULL,'Cutomer bookmark oauth login in browser','2020-02-04 08:25:22',NULL,NULL),(180,734886,'Incident','AT Entries extranet - Create user for 52117',NULL,'Resolved','Customer requested to create the AT user for AT centre 52117. We are unable to enter email addresses onto Entries Extranet where there are more than three letters after the last stop.','Pralaysankar Saha','PR# 6364','2020-01-07 21:24:48','2020-01-17 19:46:21','2020-01-20 11:23:22','Entries Externate',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','The incident is related to PR# 6364. As per workaround the customer submit a demo mail id which satisfies the previous email validation condition. Then we are running a back end script which update the mail-id which customer want to submit. Then customer confirmed to close the incident.',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Technical','Avoidable','Eleminate',NULL,'PR avaliable','2020-02-04 09:37:51',NULL,NULL),(181,733475,'Incident','CI DIRECT CheckPoint 2019 candidates with no birth date',NULL,'Closed','Customer asked to investigate and advise why there are candidate entries in CI DIRECT in 2019 for candidates who have no birth date in the database.','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-01-02 16:33:00','2020-01-13 18:17:00','2020-01-20 11:26:40','CIE Direct',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','According to our discussion with customer in skype call we confirmed that the candidate created datetime for two candidates is after the May 2019 CheckPoint series entries period.  So it appears that these candidates have been recreated after the entries period, and have not been subject to CheckPoint entries validation since their creation.',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Operational','Unavoidable','Automate',NULL,'From back end incomplete script ran','2020-02-04 09:29:39',NULL,NULL),(182,737515,'Incident','Destination Lane Unavailable',NULL,'Resolved','This morning at 09:19 three OCR script packets were routed incorrectly down Outfeed 12 - Post Exams Awaiting Despatch. Upon further investigation it was discovered that the Destination Lane was displaying Not available on the STS Packets Details page; however when I revisited the STS Packets Details Page at 09:50 the lane is now showing as correctly as Lane 19 - Scan Bureau DC10 (OCR). Please can you investigate the cause of the lane being','Alamgir Ali SK',NULL,'2020-01-16 17:15:30','2020-01-22 21:15:00','2020-01-20 11:45:51','STS',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','1.When EPS send any update feed ,STS job change destinationid as null .\n       ?If we call automation service, it will the packet to lane 12 as no destination was there \n2. DB getDestination job runs every half an hour, it will pick all the records where destination is not set yet. Then according to logic ,It will set proper destination for each packet. \n   ?Now here, if we call automation service, it will send the packet to proper lane.\nSo nothing to worry, System is working as expected.\n',NULL,'Java','N',' ',NULL,'','','Operational','Unavoidable','Automate',NULL,'Half hourly job corrected the worn lane in next cycle','2020-02-04 08:01:03',NULL,NULL),(183,738078,'Incident','ZD1100652 - Bulats Token Reports',NULL,'Closed','Victoria Watkins is asking if it\'s possible for us to provide her a report of the remaining BULATS tokens on the platform.\n\nShe is also asking if it\'s possible to get a report with the name of indirect customers and corresponding number per indirect customer.','Vivek Sen',NULL,'2020-01-18 18:52:03','2020-01-22 13:12:00','2020-01-20 13:22:07','BULATS',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','Informed customer to to raise SR instead of Incident',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Knowledge','Unavoidable','Industrialise',NULL,'Should be SR','2020-02-06 10:18:50',NULL,NULL),(184,228394,'Service Request','Request for Data: BULATS agent/DC Reports.',NULL,'Fulfilled',NULL,'Vivek Sen',NULL,'2020-01-07 19:03:56',NULL,'2020-01-20 13:34:03','BULATS',5,'N',0,'N','N','N',NULL,NULL,'Java','N',' ',NULL,'','',' ',' ',' ',NULL,NULL,'2020-01-22 09:54:01',NULL,NULL),(185,228723,'Service Request','Miscellaneous: DT Java',NULL,'Fulfilled',NULL,'Vivek Sen',NULL,'2020-01-09 19:07:39','1970-01-01 01:00:00','2020-01-20 13:37:45','BULATS',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','As requersted, BULATS tokens were removed through sql script.\n\nCustomer confirmed to close the call.',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-01-31 14:52:04',NULL,NULL),(186,229351,'Service Request','Miscellaneous: DT Java',NULL,'Fulfilled','BULATS tokens transfer request to Linguaskill.','Vivek Sen',NULL,'2020-01-16 19:09:40','2020-02-06 12:20:00','2020-01-20 13:39:53','BULATS',5,'N',0,'N','N','N','Request Fulfilled.',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-02-06 14:26:28',NULL,NULL),(187,229760,'Service Request','BULATS Report',NULL,'Waiting for Customer',NULL,'Vivek Sen',NULL,'2020-01-21 05:30:00','1970-01-01 05:30:00','2020-01-22 08:37:38','STS',0,'N',0,'N','N','N',NULL,NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-05-03 17:09:44',NULL,NULL),(188,738327,'Incident','RVS: Unable to see candidate photo',NULL,'Resolved','Photo was not showing','Vivek Sen',NULL,'2020-01-20 05:30:00','1970-01-01 05:30:00','2020-01-22 08:39:34','RVS',0,'N',0,'N','N','N','Advised customer to check from RVS(RO) Portal , customer didn\'t respond',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Knowledge','Unavoidable','Eleminate',NULL,'Customer didn\'t respond','2020-02-04 08:21:23',NULL,NULL),(189,738612,'Incident','EPS push to ATS Entries UAT Extranet not working',NULL,'Resolved','The June (ARD) 2020 session has been approved in MUAT EPS Session Review and in the appropriate Product Range for the three STEP assessments.\n\nThe data has failed to push to the Entries UAT Extranet.  The expected result of setting up this ref data in EPS is that the session would come across and appear under the sessions tab in the Extranet.\n\nBTS have advised the push/pulls are working as usual.','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-01-21 14:33:37','2020-01-22 17:31:00','2020-01-22 12:27:26','Entries Externate',5,'N',0,'N','N','N','ENTRIESEXTRANET_REFERENCE_DATE job is  disabled in UAT environment and this job actually pushed the data from STAGING TABLE DT_PRD.EPS_SESSION to entriesextranet.EPS_SESSION .\nSo we are enabling the job to push the data from staging table to entries_extranet. After that \'June 2020\' is shown in sessions tab in entries extranet. Then the customer confirmed to close the incident.',NULL,'Java','N',' ',NULL,'','','Technical','Avoidable','Eleminate',NULL,'THIS is UAT issue , will not come under smart opps','2020-02-04 09:45:12',NULL,NULL),(190,738696,'Incident','Verification Login - https://verificationservice.cambridgeenglish.org/',NULL,'Resolved','Site: https://verificationservice.cambridgeenglish.org/\nUser: b.j.pilkington@lse.ac.uk\n\nMultiple users at lse.ac.uk, for instance b.j.pilkington@lse.ac.uk, are unable to log into the above candidate verification site and see the attached error.  Please can you investigate and fix so they can access the site?  I was not able to log into the site either and attempted to get a password reset but the email to reset never arrived.','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-01-21 16:30:50','2020-01-21 18:43:00','2020-01-22 12:31:20','RVS',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','TheURL was bokmarked and due to that it caused an Auth0 issue. Advised user to access the URL directly and as per the confirmation user was able to login successfully. Hence closing the call.',NULL,'Java','N',' ',NULL,'','','Knowledge','Unavoidable','Industrialise',NULL,'User bookmered OAuth login page','2020-02-04 09:39:28',NULL,NULL),(191,738398,'Incident','Associate centre cannot approve sub-centre enquiry about results in CIE Direct',NULL,'Resolved','Centre SA011 is an Associate Centre. One of its sub-centres, SA234, has placed an enquiry about result for approval by SA011 in CIE Direct.\n\nThere should be a button for SA011 to press in their Direct account - the button is normally labelled as \'Approve and Submit to Cambridge\'. The centre reports, however, that there is no button. SA011 cannot therefore approve the sub-centre enquiry.','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-01-20 18:05:36','2020-01-20 21:01:00','2020-01-22 12:36:50','CIE Direct',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','The centre has reported the issue is not there and thus the issue resolved automatically. So we are closing the incident as of now.',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Knowledge','Unavoidable','Industrialise',NULL,'User wrong activity','2020-02-04 09:28:39',NULL,NULL),(192,738383,'Incident',' Cambridge Assessment English - STEP 2019 - Request Copy of Results After the 60 Day Period',NULL,'Resolved','Customer requested to provide the candidate\'s SOR','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-01-20 17:29:35','2020-01-20 22:23:00','2020-01-22 12:41:51','Entries Externate',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','We have sent the required SOR to the customer and customer confirmed to close the incident.\n\n',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Knowledge','Unavoidable','Industrialise',NULL,'Incident created instead of SR','2020-02-04 09:32:21',NULL,NULL),(198,737230,'Incident','RF guns and STS',NULL,'Resolved','All staff using RF guns and trying to access STS are having issues - asking for username and password - receiving error message \"HTTP 401\".\nI don\'t know whether it\'s a connection issue, as it doesn\'t happen all of the time.\nCan someone please investigate this?\nKind regards,\nBen Wright\nDistribution Supervisor\nLogistics and Scanning Operations','Alamgir Ali SK',NULL,'2020-01-15 12:46:30','1970-01-01 01:00:00','2020-01-24 07:16:57','STS',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','Incident reassigned to Service Desk. Java APO don\'t work this issue',NULL,'Java','N','Serivce Desk',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Knowledge','Unavoidable','Eleminate',NULL,'Java APO don\'t work on RF gun issue','2020-02-04 07:59:32',NULL,NULL),(199,739037,'Incident','Transfering BULATS tokens to Linguaskill - ES492',NULL,'Resolved','We received a request (approved by the local team) to move unused BULATS tokens to Linguaskill for centre ES492 - Kennedy - Empowering Successful Communication. Could you kindly let us know how many tokens they have and remove them from the BULATS platform. Once the number is confirmed we will be able to add them manually','Vivek Sen',NULL,'2020-01-22 13:08:05','2020-01-22 05:30:00','2020-01-24 07:38:59','BULATS',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','Informed customer to to raise SR instead of Incident',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Knowledge','Unavoidable','Industrialise',NULL,'Should be SR','2020-02-06 10:18:42',NULL,NULL),(200,739141,'Incident','ZD1104080 Results Verification Site: Issues Adding users to CPE Verification Website',NULL,'Closed','Portal: Results Verification Site\nInstitution name: London School of Economics and Political Science\nCentre number: 2900\nUser and login ID : B.J.Pilkington@lse.ac.uk /Grad6799\n\nThe user cannot add a user to their organization. I replicated the error, nothing happens when Add User is clicked, it\'s like the site is unresponsive. Please help:\n[https://esolhelpdesk.zendesk.com/attachments/token/64whIUiuremTusaaOWAD1Km59/?name=inline1488011523.png]\n','Vivek Sen','PR 6987','2020-01-22 14:09:13','1970-01-01 01:00:00','2020-01-24 08:39:18','RVS',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','Given task to Shaun to delete user from OAUth',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Technical','Avoidable','Eleminate',NULL,'PR 6987 Avaliable','2020-02-04 08:20:43',NULL,NULL),(201,739300,'Incident','June 2020] HK055 - CSV file not loading to Direct',NULL,'Resolved','June 2020] HK055 - CSV file not loading to Direct','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-01-23 14:11:27','2020-01-29 08:42:00','2020-01-24 08:41:36','CIE Direct',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','We have modified the csv file which center HK055 want to upload. Then we were checking that in our support environment. It is successfully updated in our support environment.\nThen we sent the csv file to the customer. They also checked in the UAT environment and the csv file was suvccessfully uploaded.\nThen they sent it to the center user . but the user is not replyed for 3-4 days.Sio customer told us to close the incident. If the user face any issue to upload the csv file then again they will create a new incident for that.',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Knowledge','Unavoidable','Industrialise',NULL,'Should be SR','2020-02-06 10:20:21',NULL,NULL),(202,739371,'Incident','Centre IT844 - Bulats tokens',NULL,'Resolved','We were advised that Centre IT844 has 800 Bulats tokens. They would like to convert these tokens into CEPT & YLPT ones.\n\nPlease, may I ask you to confirm that Centre IT844 - EINSTEINWEB has indeed 800 unused tokens and please remove them, so we can convert them as requested.\n','Vivek Sen',NULL,'2020-01-23 14:15:46','2020-01-23 05:30:00','2020-01-24 08:45:51','BULATS',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','Informed customer to to raise SR instead of Incident',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Knowledge','Unavoidable','Industrialise',NULL,'Should be SR','2020-02-06 10:18:32',NULL,NULL),(203,739130,'Incident','June 2020] CN749 Issue with resubmitting entries',NULL,'Resolved','Cambridge Assessment International Education prepares school students for life, helping them develop an informed curiosity and a lasting passion for learning. We are part of the University of Cambridge.','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-01-22 14:58:53','2020-01-23 05:30:00','2020-01-24 09:29:01','CIE Direct',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','Backed script run',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Knowledge','Unavoidable','Industrialise',NULL,'User wrong activity','2020-02-04 09:28:18',NULL,NULL),(204,230016,'Service Request','Request for Data: STS',NULL,'Fulfilled',NULL,'Alamgir Ali SK',NULL,'2020-01-22 15:23:45','2020-01-29 16:29:00','2020-01-24 09:53:53','STS',5,'N',0,'N','N','N','Report sent to customer.\nCustomer asked to close it.',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-01-30 15:27:07',NULL,NULL),(205,230029,'Service Request','Miscellaneous: Transfering BULATS tokens to Linguaskill - ES492',NULL,'Fulfilled',NULL,'Vivek Sen',NULL,'2020-01-22 15:31:30',NULL,'2020-01-24 10:01:35','BULATS',5,'N',0,'N','N','N',NULL,NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-01-24 14:54:52',NULL,NULL),(206,227912,'Service Request','Needed for Code review in sprint items.',NULL,'Fulfilled',NULL,'Vivek Sen',NULL,'2019-12-30 18:54:44',NULL,'2020-01-24 13:24:55','RVS',5,'N',0,'N','N','N',NULL,NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(207,740349,'Incident','IN447 CI Direct account',NULL,'Resolved','Centre IN447 had an amendment for the March 2020 series left as \"Amendment to Submit\" after the final entry deadline 26 January.\n\nWe have now processed this on EPS, but I think in order for the centre\'s Cambridge International Direct account to reflect the correct entry you will need to update the EPS feedback to their account?','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-01-27 16:15:00','2020-01-29 12:07:00','2020-01-28 10:04:25','CIE Direct',0,'N',0,'N','N','N','We had investigated the issue. We found that CIE Direct users update option  from ‘DV’ to ‘AY’ on 25th Jan,2020  but the entry is not submitted to EPS because the entry was last updated by EPS on 23rd Jan,2020  and the processing status is unsubmitted.\nFrom EPS end the candidate entry was pushed to CIE Direct on 27th Jan but since the ProcessingStatus is ‘UnSubmitted’ in Backend . So the above table is not updated in CIE Direct. So \'Amendments to Submit\' was showing in backend.\nAfter talking with customer in mail we prepared a back end script and after running the backend script the customer confirmed that the issue is not there and the client is told to close the incident.',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Knowledge','Unavoidable','Industrialise',NULL,'User wrong activity , forgot to submit after creating stub','2020-02-04 09:27:58',NULL,NULL),(208,739563,'Incident','[May 2020] JO001 (British Council) cannot see JO214 (Direct)',NULL,'Resolved','Centre JO001 has submitted entries for centre JO214 for May 2020 exam series via CAMEO file- AJO001.X09. Entries are already in EPS.\n\nExam series: May 2020\nCentre: JO001 (British Council)\nSub centre: JO214\n\nHowever British Council- JO001 cannot see centre J0214  listed as their sub-centre in Cambridge International Direct. Therefore JO001 cannot see the entries of centre JO214.\nWe have checked in C4C and JO001 is a parent centre for JO214. Centre JO001  should see the entries of JO214.\n\n','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-01-24 10:05:15','2020-01-29 09:43:00','2020-01-28 10:05:28','CIE Direct',5,'N',0,'N','N','N','Customer confirmed that we can close the incident because they had received confirmation from the customer registration team that center JO001able to see their subcenter JO214 now. They had just checked in the direct and confirmed that entries of JO021 are visible to their parent center JO214.',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,'','','Knowledge','Unavoidable','Industrialise',NULL,'User wrong activity','2020-02-04 09:27:12',NULL,NULL),(209,737772,'Incident','CECP - Results Service for Candidates',NULL,'Resolved',NULL,'Vivek Sen',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-01-28 10:05:37','RVS',0,'N',0,'N','N','N',NULL,NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-01-30 12:02:50',NULL,NULL),(210,740407,'Incident','Script Tracking System - Failure ,Duplicate',NULL,'Closed','Duplicate IDOC file found','Alamgir Ali SK','PR 7579','2020-01-28 10:05:54','2020-01-29 04:36:00','2020-01-28 10:05:59','STS',4,'N',0,'N','N','N','PR 7579 associated with this.\nBut solution not deployed in production.\nPR is in close status not able to tag it.\n\nIssue was due to multiple files in STS folder for which we believe a fix is being carried out at STS end as per our earlier discussion. For this issue, we could see that it has initially created a file in STS folder on 27th and on the next day morning another file was picked in another job. \n\nSo I believe the respective packets should be available in STS and if the packets are present in STS end for the respective Idoc id, then we would suggest to ignore this error.\n',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,'','','Technical','Avoidable','Eleminate',NULL,'Already PR and JIRA story avaliable, not yet promoted to PRD ','2020-02-04 07:59:01',NULL,NULL),(211,740581,'Incident','Centre TH072 - Enquiries about Results Booking Issue',NULL,'Resolved','Customer told that Centre TH072 reports being unable to select an eligible candidate when creating an enquiry about results in CIE Direct.\n\nThe syllabus is 0580, components 22 & 42, the candidate number is 0002 and the series November 2019. ','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-01-28 12:12:10','2020-01-29 08:16:00','2020-01-29 08:26:30','CIE Direct',5,'N',0,'N','N','N','We had investigated the issue. We found that CIE Direct users on 21st Nov,2019 but the entry is not submitted to EPS because the entry was last updated by EPS on 20rd Jan,2019 and the processing status is unsubmitted.\nFrom EPS end the candidate entry was pushed to CIE Direct on 18th Dec  but since the ProcessingStatus is ‘UnSubmitted’ in Backend . So the above table is not updated in CIE Direct. So \'Amendments to Submit\' was showing in backend. So the customer could not create entry for candidate.\nAfter talking with customer in skype we prepared a back end script and after running the backend script the customer cn book entry for the candidate and the client is agreed to close the incident.',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,'','','Knowledge','Unavoidable','Industrialise',NULL,'User wrong activity','2020-02-04 09:25:16',NULL,NULL),(212,230483,'Service Request','Packet arrive at centres report',NULL,'Closed',NULL,'Alamgir Ali SK',NULL,'2020-01-28 12:37:35','2020-01-30 02:33:00','2020-01-29 09:48:20','STS',3,'N',0,'N','N','N','Report sent to customer.\nCustomer confirmed to close this SR.',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-01-30 15:23:37',NULL,NULL),(213,230158,'Service Request','Bulats to Linguaskill token transfer',NULL,'Fulfilled',NULL,'Vivek Sen',NULL,'2020-01-23 00:00:00','2020-01-31 00:00:00','2020-01-29 09:50:00','BULATS',0,'N',0,'N','N','N',NULL,NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-02-06 14:59:21',NULL,NULL),(214,230550,'Service Request','CIE STS packet report with qualifi