1\nSeries: Nov 2019','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-01-30 16:23:57',NULL,'2020-01-31 15:21:38','CIE Direct',5,'N',0,'N','N','N',NULL,NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(264,740493,'Incident','FW: query about STS',NULL,'Resolved','Requested for a report','Alamgir Ali SK',NULL,'2020-01-28 10:07:27','2020-01-28 08:48:00','2020-02-03 09:03:49','STS',5,'N',0,'N','N','N','Asked to raise SR',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,'','','Knowledge','Unavoidable','Industrialise',NULL,'Supposed to be SR, but incident raised','2020-02-06 14:42:49',NULL,NULL),(265,230830,'Service Request','sts data extract',NULL,'Fulfilled','sts data extract','Alamgir Ali SK',NULL,'2020-01-31 09:27:37',NULL,'2020-02-03 09:34:02','STS',5,'N',0,'N','N','N',NULL,NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-02-06 10:07:59',NULL,NULL),(269,741675,'Incident','CIEDIRECT Push AutoRestart SUCCESS',NULL,'Resolved','The CIEDIRECT push has been restarted successfully.','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-01-31 06:16:43','1970-01-01 01:00:00','2020-02-03 11:29:09','CIE Direct',5,'N',0,'N','N','N','This is not an issue.Service user created the incident since they were in cc when the mail was sent to the customer.',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Operational','Unavoidable','Automate',NULL,'BTS was in cc , so incident automatically raised','2020-02-04 07:56:19',NULL,NULL),(270,6440,'Problem Record','Normalization job stuck in production.',NULL,'Awaiting Review','Normalization job stuck in production due to job status cycle. Thus, numbers of SAP packets along with reference data has not populated at STS end and all the records are stuck in staging tables. Required alert mail configuration to create auto generated incident instead of info mail in normalization job for already running scenario.','Tuhin Ghosh',NULL,'2018-10-26 16:24:36',NULL,'2020-02-03 16:24:52','STS',5,'N',0,'N','N','N',NULL,NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(271,742011,'Incident','User Unable to log into Results Online for ELAT, TSA and TSA(S1)',NULL,'Resolved','Portal: Results Online Admissions Testing\n\nhttps://results.cambridgeassessment.org.uk/candidates/controller/open/login.html\n\nUser has reported they are unable to log in.\nUser: Daphne Phua\nEmail: Daphne.Phua@relc.org.sg\n\nDaphne is part of the RELC Examination Bureau\nand as such needs to be able access candidate results via the portal.\n\nShe has been unable to log in to the portal, she has reset her password but has still been unable to log in.\n\nCan you please look into this','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-02-03 10:29:14','2020-02-03 04:49:00','2020-02-04 08:45:57','Entries Externate',5,'N',0,'N','N','N','As per discussion in skype Customer confirmed to close the incident because the user is not registered on the site Result Online for centres.',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','null',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-02-04 08:50:02',NULL,NULL),(272,742426,'Incident','CIE Direct SAS Replacement Job. STATUS: FAILED',NULL,'Waiting for Customer','Following job was failed \nJob Id: 275\nStart Time: 2020-02-04 12:00:00.013\nEnd Time: 2020-02-04 12:02:34.39\nTrigger User: SAS_SCHEDULER_TRIGGER\nStatus: FAILED\nFailed Step: UPDATE_CIE_DB\nFailed Msg: could not execute native bulk manipulation query','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-02-04 12:27:50','1970-01-01 01:00:00','2020-02-05 09:16:45','CIE Direct',5,'N',0,'N','N','N','We were investigated and after that we are confirmed that the main centre file has duplicate entries.\n\nFor that reason the SAS job was failed.\n\nSo we are suggesting to customer to rectify the main centre file and run the SAS job again.\n\nThe customer pass back to the business team and ask them to resolve the issue.\n\nAfter that the C4C file was changed and then the SAS job was running successfully. \nSo we are closing the incident.',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-02-07 10:00:26',NULL,NULL),(273,230784,'Service Request','Bulats to Linguaskill token conversion',NULL,'Waiting for Customer','Bulats to Linguaskill token conversion','Vivek Sen',NULL,'2020-01-31 12:58:29',NULL,'2020-02-05 11:58:46','BULATS',3,'N',0,'N','N','N',NULL,NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(274,742787,'Incident','CIE Direct SAS Replacement Job. STATUS: FAILED',NULL,'Resolved','Below SAS jobs are failed\nJob Id: 277\nStart Time: 2020-02-05 12:00:00.01\nEnd Time: 2020-02-05 12:02:52.98\nTrigger User: SAS_SCHEDULER_TRIGGER\nStatus: FAILED\nFailed Step: UPDATE_CIE_DB\nFailed Msg: could not execute native bulk manipulation query','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-02-05 12:14:40','2020-02-06 01:00:00','2020-02-06 06:41:02','CIE Direct',5,'N',0,'N','N','N','We were investigated and after that we are confirmed that the main centre file has duplicate entries.\n\nFor that reason the SAS job was failed.\n\nSo we are suggesting to customer to rectify the main centre file and run the SAS job again.\n\nThe customer pass back to the business team and ask them to resolve the issue.\n\nSince this incident similar to Incident# 742426. We are closing this incident.',NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-02-06 06:44:11',NULL,NULL),(275,742996,'Incident','User unable to login to Admissions Testing Results online',NULL,'Waiting for Customer','Portal: Admissions Testing Results online\nhttps://results.cambridgeassessment.org.uk/centres/controller/centre/centreResults.html\n\n\nUser has reported that they could not log in to the portal.\nThe account is linked to the Admissions Testing Entries Extranet\nhttps://www.entries.cambridgeassessment.org/entries-extranet/controller/open/login.html\n','Pralaysankar Saha',NULL,'2020-02-06 09:19:06',NULL,'2020-02-06 10:06:23','Entries Externate',5,'N',0,'N','N','N',NULL,NULL,'Java','N',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(277,7601,'Problem Record','Packets with no messages still coming to the 